WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.800
Our army's how is morale?

00:10.240 --> 00:16.320
This time the Wutu have mobilized fifty thousand while we only have five thousand in this situation.

00:16.400 --> 00:22.560
The few hundred elite cavalry who've followed me may fight to the death but the other soldiers may waver.

00:22.640 --> 00:28.960
However Yiyang City has strong and complete walls and with Your Highness here all are united.

00:29.040 --> 00:33.920
At least can hold for five days before the enemy's full assault.

00:34.560 --> 00:38.120
If there's no major defeat should be able to hold for seven days.

